@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title Ch07.01: AI 트래픽 데이터 수집 - 전체 아키텍처

left to right direction

package "애플리케이션" {
    component "HTTP 요청" as HTTPRequest
    component "MetricInterceptor" as Interceptor
    component "MetricCollectorService" as Collector
    component "AnomalyDetectionService" as AnomalyDetector
    component "TrafficMetricsController" as Controller
}

database "H2 Database" as DB {
    table "traffic_metrics" as MetricsTable
}

package "모니터링" {
    component "Prometheus" as Prometheus
    component "Grafana" as Grafana
}

HTTPRequest --> Interceptor : HTTP 요청
Interceptor --> Collector : 메트릭 기록
Collector --> DB : 메트릭 저장 (1분마다)
Collector --> MetricsTable : INSERT

AnomalyDetector --> DB : 메트릭 조회
AnomalyDetector --> MetricsTable : 이상치 업데이트 (1분마다)

Controller --> DB : 메트릭 조회 API
Controller --> Prometheus : Prometheus 형식 메트릭

Prometheus --> Controller : 메트릭 수집 (15초마다)
Prometheus --> Grafana : 메트릭 제공
Grafana --> Prometheus : 쿼리

note right of Collector
    수집 메트릭:
    - TPS
    - Latency (평균, P95, P99)
    - Error Rate
    - Resource (CPU, Memory, Connection Pool)
end note

note right of AnomalyDetector
    AI 이상 탐지:
    - 정상 패턴 학습 (1시간마다)
    - 이상치 감지 (1분마다)
    - Z-score 기반
end note

@enduml

@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title Ch07.01: 데이터 파이프라인 - 수집 → 저장 → 처리 → 시각화

left to right direction

component "1. 수집\n(Collection)" as Collection
component "2. 저장\n(Storage)" as Storage
component "3. 처리\n(Processing)" as Processing
component "4. 시각화\n(Visualization)" as Visualization

Collection --> Storage : 메트릭 데이터
Storage --> Processing : 메트릭 조회
Processing --> Storage : 이상치 업데이트
Storage --> Visualization : 메트릭 조회

note right of Collection
    구현:
    - MetricInterceptor
    - MetricCollectorService
    주기: 실시간 수집, 1분마다 집계
end note

note right of Storage
    구현:
    - TrafficMetricRepository
    - H2 Database
    형식: TrafficMetric 엔티티
end note

note right of Processing
    구현:
    - AnomalyDetectionService
    방법: Z-score 기반 이상 탐지
    주기: 1분마다 이상 탐지
end note

note right of Visualization
    구현:
    - Grafana + Prometheus
    형식: 실시간 대시보드
    용도: 인사이트 시각화
end note

@enduml

@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title Ch07.01: 메트릭 수집 시퀀스

actor "Client" as Client
participant "MetricInterceptor" as Interceptor
participant "MetricCollectorService" as Collector
database "TrafficMetric\nRepository" as Repository
database "H2 Database" as DB

Client -> Interceptor: HTTP 요청 (/api/orders)
activate Interceptor

Interceptor -> Interceptor: preHandle()\n시작 시간 기록
activate Interceptor

Interceptor -> Client: 요청 처리
deactivate Interceptor

Client --> Interceptor: 응답
activate Interceptor

Interceptor -> Interceptor: afterCompletion()\n응답 시간 계산
Interceptor -> Collector: recordRequest(endpoint, responseTime, success)
activate Collector

Collector -> Collector: MetricWindow에 기록
note right of Collector
    실시간 메트릭 수집:
    - 요청 수
    - 응답 시간
    - 성공/실패 여부
end note
deactivate Collector
deactivate Interceptor

== 주기적 집계 (1분마다) ==

Collector -> Collector: @Scheduled collectAndSaveMetrics()
activate Collector

Collector -> Collector: TPS, Latency, Error Rate 계산
Collector -> Collector: Resource 사용률 수집

Collector -> Repository: save(TrafficMetric)
activate Repository
Repository -> DB: INSERT INTO traffic_metrics
activate DB
DB --> Repository: 성공
deactivate DB
Repository --> Collector: TrafficMetric
deactivate Repository

Collector -> Collector: MetricWindow 초기화
deactivate Collector

note over Client, DB
    메트릭 수집:
    - 실시간 수집
    - 1분마다 집계 및 저장
    - TPS, Latency, Error Rate, Resource
end note

@enduml

@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title Ch07.01: AI 이상 탐지 시퀀스

participant "AnomalyDetectionService" as AnomalyDetector
database "TrafficMetric\nRepository" as Repository
database "H2 Database" as DB

== 정상 패턴 학습 (1시간마다) ==

AnomalyDetector -> AnomalyDetector: @Scheduled learnNormalPattern()
activate AnomalyDetector

AnomalyDetector -> Repository: findByTimestampBetween(1시간 전, 현재)
activate Repository
Repository -> DB: SELECT * FROM traffic_metrics
activate DB
DB --> Repository: 최근 1시간 메트릭
deactivate DB
Repository --> AnomalyDetector: List<TrafficMetric>
deactivate Repository

AnomalyDetector -> AnomalyDetector: calculatePatternStatistics()
note right of AnomalyDetector
    통계 계산:
    - 평균 TPS, 표준편차
    - 평균 Latency, 표준편차
    - 평균 Error Rate, 표준편차
end note

AnomalyDetector -> AnomalyDetector: normalPattern 저장
deactivate AnomalyDetector

== 이상치 감지 (1분마다) ==

AnomalyDetector -> AnomalyDetector: @Scheduled detectAnomalies()
activate AnomalyDetector

AnomalyDetector -> Repository: findByTimestampAfter(1분 전)
activate Repository
Repository -> DB: SELECT * FROM traffic_metrics
activate DB
DB --> Repository: 최근 1분 메트릭
deactivate DB
Repository --> AnomalyDetector: List<TrafficMetric>
deactivate Repository

loop 각 메트릭에 대해
    AnomalyDetector -> AnomalyDetector: detectAnomaly(metric)
    activate AnomalyDetector
    
    AnomalyDetector -> AnomalyDetector: Z-score 계산\n(TPS, Latency, Error Rate)
    AnomalyDetector -> AnomalyDetector: Resource 사용률 확인
    AnomalyDetector -> AnomalyDetector: 이상치 점수 계산
    
    alt 이상치 감지 (score > 0.5)
        AnomalyDetector -> Repository: update(metric)
        activate Repository
        Repository -> DB: UPDATE traffic_metrics\nSET is_anomaly=true
        activate DB
        DB --> Repository: 성공
        deactivate DB
        Repository --> AnomalyDetector: TrafficMetric
        deactivate Repository
        
        note right of AnomalyDetector
            이상치 정보:
            - isAnomaly: true
            - anomalyScore: 0.0~1.0
            - anomalyReason: 원인 설명
        end note
    end
    
    deactivate AnomalyDetector
end

deactivate AnomalyDetector

@enduml

